              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eng’ Hebronik, ko kiribei Asabia ak tupchosiekyik, bik che nyigonen elfut agenge ak bogol tisab, Israel eng’ Jordan bitonin komostab cherongo; agobo boisionik tugul che bo Jehovah, ak otisietab laitoriat.",
          "type": "text",
