          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Che bo Hebronik, ko ki Jerija ne o, che bo Hebronik, ko u ibinwekwak, eng’ gorikab kwanisiek. Kigicheng’ bichoto eng’ kenyitab artam ne bo laitornatetab Daudi, ak kibiit eng’ ichek bik che kimen che nyigonen eng’ Jaser ne bo Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak tupchosiekyik, che ki bik che nyigonen, ko kiek elfusiek aeng’ ak bogol tisab, kandoikab gorikab kwanisiek, che kiinde laitoriat Daudi koboi bikab Reuben, ak Gadik, ak kebebertab bororietab Manase, agobo kiy age tugul ne tokyingei Kamuktaindet, ak ng’alekab laitoriat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.32",
